   1:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** /*
   2:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** 
   3:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** This is an implementation of the AES algorithm, specifically ECB, CTR and CBC mode.
   4:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** Block size can be chosen in aes.h - available choices are AES128, AES192, AES256.
   5:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** 
   6:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** The implementation is verified against the test vectors in:
   7:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c ****   National Institute of Standards and Technology Special Publication 800-38A 2001 ED
   8:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** 
   9:../../iut/tiny-AES-c/aes.c **** ECB-AES128
